  "description": "The CGR Ti-X is an elegant, versatile titanium all-rounder that pairs the proven go-anywhere CGR design with the timeless strength, comfort, and ride quality of triple-butted titanium. Light, responsive, and built to go the distance, it’s a bike that feels as good on the last mile as it does on the first. Shimano’s Ultegra Di2 12-speed groupset delivers fast, flawless shifting on any terrain, while Ksyrium 30 wheels and 40mm Schwalbe G-One Allround tyres add the perfect mix of grip, speed, and comfort. Finished with a Selle Italia Model X saddle, the CGR Ti-X is ready for wherever the road, or trail, takes you.",
